313\">\n    <div class=\"pf-pin\" id=\"pfPin\" data-kid=\"314\">\n      <div class=\"wrap\" data-kid=\"315\">\n        <div class=\"pf-grid\" data-kid=\"316\">\n          <div class=\"pf-left\" data-kid=\"317\">\n            <div class=\"sec-eye\" data-kid=\"318\">SECTION 03 — PROVABLY FAIR</div>\n            <h2 class=\"pf-h\" data-kid=\"319\">Why trust<br data-kid=\"320\">the <span class=\"strike\" data-kid=\"321\">house</span>?<br data-kid=\"322\"><span class=\"c-gold\" data-kid=\"323\">Don't.\n                Verify.</span></h2>\n\n            <div class=\"pf-panels\" id=\"pfPanels\" data-kid=\"324\">\n              <div class=\"pf-panel active\" data-p=\"0\" data-kid=\"325\">\n                <p data-kid=\"326\">Before any reel spins, we commit a hashed <span class=\"g\" data-kid=\"327\">server seed</span>. You provide your <span class=\"per\" data-kid=\"328\">client seed</span>. The outcome is computed deterministically using both seeds and a\n                  public nonce.</p>\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"pf-panel\" data-p=\"1\" data-kid=\"329\">\n                <p data-kid=\"330\">As you play, the <span class=\"per\" data-kid=\"331\">nonce</span> increments with every round. The result of each spin\n                  is bound to the exact same commitment you saw at the start — it cannot be swapped mid-session.</p>\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"pf-panel\" data-p=\"2\" data-kid=\"332\">\n                <p data-kid=\"333\">After your session, the server seed is revealed. Hash it. If it doesn't match the original\n                  commitment, the round is void and you are made whole. <span class=\"j\" data-kid=\"334\">No exceptions.</span></p>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"pf-progress\" data-kid=\"335\"><i class=\"on\" data-kid=\"336\"></i><i data-kid=\"337\"></i><i data-kid=\"338\"></i></div>\n\n            <div class=\"pf-steps\" data-kid=\"339\">\n              <div class=\"pf-step s1\" data-kid=\"340\">\n                <div class=\"n\" data-kid=\"341\">01</div>\n                <div class=\"lab\" data-kid=\"342\">COMMIT</div>\n                <div class=\"d\" data-kid=\"343\">SHA-256 published</div>\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"pf-step s2\" data-kid=\"344\">\n                <div class=\"n\" data-kid=\"345\">02</div>\n                <div class=\"lab\" data-kid=\"346\">PLAY</div>\n                <div class=\"d\" data-kid=\"347\">Nonce increments</div>\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"pf-step s3\" data-kid=\"348\">\n                <div class=\"n\" data-kid=\"349\">03</div>\n                <div class=\"lab\" data-kid=\"350\">REVEAL</div>\n                <div class=\"d\" data-kid=\"351\">Anyone can verify</div>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n          \n          <div class=\"term\" data-kid=\"352\">\n            <div class=\"term-bar\" data-kid=\"353\">\n              <div class=\"lights\" data-kid=\"354\"><i data-kid=\"355\"></i><i data-kid=\"356\"></i><i data-kid=\"357\"></i></div>\n              <span class=\"g\" data-kid=\"358\">~/verify · sha256</span>\n              <span data-kid=\"359\">v3.14.2</span>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"term-body\" data-kid=\"360\">\n              <div class=\"ln tm\" data-kid=\"361\">$ neon-verify --interactive</div>\n              <div class=\"ln tg\" data-kid=\"362\">→ initialising verifier session…</div>\n              <div class=\"ln ti\" data-kid=\"363\">→ load commitment 0x9F3a…E2c1 ✓</div>\n              <div class=\"ln tm\" data-kid=\"364\">→ awaiting inputs…</div>\n              <div style=\"margin-top:16px\" data-kid=\"365\">\n                <label class=\"label\" style=\"color:var(--muted);display:block;margin-bottom:4px\" data-kid=\"366\">CLIENT SEED</label>\n                <input class=\"term-in\" value=\"kabuki-2024-rng\" aria-label=\"Client seed\" data-kid=\"367\">\n              </div>\n         